0 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 123456 789 1234567890 ");
        AddRecommendedBuilds(new List<RecommendedBuild> { testBuild1, testBuild2, testBuild3, testBuild4 });
    }

    private void InitializeRecommendedBuildsList()
    {
        foreach (var shipIndex in AppData.ShipDictionary.Keys)
        {
            recommendedBuilds.Add(shipIndex, []);
        }
    }

    private void AddRecommendedBuilds(IEnumerable<RecommendedBuild> builds)
    {
        foreach (var build in builds)
        {
            if (recommendedBuilds.TryGetValue(build.BuildContainer.Build!.ShipIndex, out var value))
            {
                value.Add(build);
            }
            else
            {
                recommendedBuilds.Add(build.BuildContainer.Build!.ShipIndex, [build]);
            }
        }
    }

    private bool IsSmallScreen()
    {
        return breakpointProvider.Breakpoint is Breakpoint.Xs or Breakpoint.Sm;
    }

    private void GoToShipPage()
    {
        AppNavigator.NavigateTo(AppNavigator.AppPage.ShipStats, selectedBuilds.Select(x => ShipBuildContainer.CreateNew(AppData.ShipDictionary[x.BuildContainer.Build!.ShipIndex], x.BuildContainer.Build, ImmutableArray<int>.Empty)).ToImmutableList());
    }

    private void SelectBuild(RecommendedBuild recommendedBuild)
    {
        selectedBuilds.Add(recommendedBuild);
    }

    private void SelectShip(string index)
    {
        shipBuilds = recommendedBuilds[index];
        selectedShip = AppData.ShipDictionary[index];
    }
}

